<div className={styles.pvlRoot}>
	<div class="pvlRichtext"><div class="wayout" style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 2.25rem;"><!-- PROMISE -->
<section id="top" class="text-white" style="background-color: #002056; border-radius: 20px; overflow: hidden;">
<div class="row g-4 align-items-stretch" style="margin: 0; padding: clamp(1.5rem,4vw,2.75rem);">
<div class="col-lg-7 d-flex flex-column justify-content-start" style="gap: 1.25rem;"><!-- TODO: re-host the white logo on Zesty media -->
<h1 class="f-ajenson mb-0" style="color: #fff; font-size: clamp(2rem,4.2vw,3.1rem); line-height: 1.1;"><img style="height: auto; width: 80%;" src="https://8hxvw8tw.media.zestyio.com/2.r1Ss51QqMl.png" alt="2.r1Ss51QqMl.png"><br>Off the streets. Off drugs.&nbsp;<br>Back to life.</h1>
<p class="mb-0" style="font-size: 1.05rem; line-height: 1.55; max-width: 56ch;"><em>The Way Out</em> is a recovery-focused homelessness initiative of The Salvation Army San Francisco designed to get people off the streets, get people off drugs, and give them back their lives.</p>
<p class="mb-0" style="font-size: 1.05rem; line-height: 1.55; max-width: 56ch;">Services are delivered through a Recovery System of Care and include detox, shelter, and stabilization; residential drug treatment; recovery housing and independent living; workforce development and life skills; and an alumni support network.</p>
<div class="d-flex flex-wrap align-items-center" style="gap: 1.25rem; margin-top: .35rem;"><a class="btn btn-primary btn-lg" href="https://give-gs.salvationarmy.org/give/336361?wayout=true&amp;_ga=2.135698103.729685781.1706639656-212087624.1705156517#!/donation/checkout" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Support The Way Out</a> <a style="color: #fff; text-decoration: underline;" href="https://thewayoutsf.wixsite.com/referrals/hl-referral" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Submit a referral</a></div>
</div>
<div class="col-lg-5 d-flex"><!-- TODO: re-host the hero photo on Zesty media -->
<div style="border-radius: 12px; min-height: 260px; overflow: hidden; width: 100%;"><img src="https://8hxvw8tw.media.zestyio.com/beach-two.jpg" alt="beach-two.jpg"></div>
</div>
</div>
</section>
<!-- RESULTS -->
<section id="results" style="background-color: #eef1f5; border-radius: 20px; padding: clamp(1.25rem,3vw,2rem);">
<h2 class="f-ajenson text-center mb-2" style="color: #002056; font-size: 1.6rem;">OUTCOMES FY 25/26</h2>
<div style="background-color: #ef3e42; height: 3px; margin: 0 auto 1.75rem; width: 58px;"></div>
<div class="row row-cols-1 row-cols-md-3 g-3">
<div class="col">
<div class="card h-100 border-0 text-center" style="border-radius: 14px;">
<div class="card-body" style="padding: 1.75rem 1.4rem;">
<div class="text-uppercase fw-bold" style="color: #002056; font-size: .72rem; letter-spacing: .1em;">Success Rate</div>
<span class="material-icons" style="color: #ef3e42; font-size: 1.7rem; margin-top: .75rem;">trending_up</span>
<div class="f-ajenson" style="color: #002056; font-size: 2.4rem; margin: .3rem 0;">77%</div>
<div class="text-muted" style="font-size: .9rem;">of recovery housing participants exit sober, employed, and stably housed</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="col">
<div class="card h-100 border-0 text-center" style="border-radius: 14px;">
<div class="card-body" style="padding: 1.75rem 1.4rem;">
<div class="text-uppercase fw-bold" style="color: #002056; font-size: .72rem; letter-spacing: .1em;">Participants</div>
<span class="material-icons" style="color: #ef3e42; font-size: 1.7rem; margin-top: .75rem;">groups</span>
<div class="f-ajenson" style="color: #002056; font-size: 2.4rem; margin: .3rem 0;">1,060</div>
<div class="text-muted" style="font-size: .9rem;">Number of participants served</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="col">
<div class="card h-100 border-0 text-center" style="border-radius: 14px;">
<div class="card-body" style="padding: 1.75rem 1.4rem;">
<div class="text-uppercase fw-bold" style="color: #002056; font-size: .72rem; letter-spacing: .1em;">Savings</div>
<span class="material-icons" style="color: #ef3e42; font-size: 1.7rem; margin-top: .75rem;">savings</span>
<div class="f-ajenson" style="color: #002056; font-size: 2.4rem; margin: .3rem 0;">$25K</div>
<div class="text-muted" style="font-size: .9rem;">Saved per participant at program exit</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</section>
<!-- PARTICIPANT STORY -->
<section id="story" class="text-white text-center" style="background-color: #002056; border-radius: 20px; padding: clamp(1.75rem,5vw,3.25rem) clamp(1.25rem,7vw,5.5rem);">
<div style="background-color: #ef3e42; height: 3px; margin: 0 auto 1.75rem; width: 52px;"></div>
<p class="f-ajenson fst-italic mb-0" style="font-size: clamp(1.05rem,2vw,1.35rem); line-height: 1.75;">"I came to Harbor Light to put back together the shattered pieces of my life. I'm grateful for this opportunity to start over and heal the broken parts of me - mind, body, and soul. It's helped me save my life in more ways than one. I've reunited with my children, my mother, and my brother, and I've found myself and my voice again through this program. Life isn't perfect, but since coming to Harbor Light, I can smile, laugh, and love myself again."</p>
<div class="text-uppercase mt-4" style="font-size: .75rem; letter-spacing: .14em;">— Harbor Light Participant</div>
</section>
<!-- RECOVERY JOURNEY — compact timeline -->
<section id="journey">
<h2 class="f-ajenson text-center mb-4" style="color: #ef3e42; font-size: clamp(1.6rem,3.2vw,2.3rem); line-height: 1.2;">From the streets to self-sufficiency. Step by step.</h2>
<ol class="row row-cols-1 row-cols-md-2 row-cols-lg-4 g-4 list-unstyled mb-0" style="background-color: #eef1f5; border-radius: 20px; margin-left: 0; margin-right: 0; padding: clamp(1.25rem,3vw,1.9rem);">
<li class="col d-flex" style="gap: .9rem; min-width: 0;"><span class="fw-bold d-inline-flex align-items-center justify-content-center flex-shrink-0" style="background-color: #ef3e42; border-radius: 50%; color: #fff; font-size: .9rem; height: 36px; width: 36px;">1</span>
<div style="min-width: 0;">
<h3 class="text-uppercase fw-bold" style="color: #002056; font-size: 1rem; letter-spacing: .04em; margin: .4rem 0 .5rem;">Stabilization</h3>
<p class="mb-0 text-muted" style="font-size: .9rem; line-height: 1.6;">Harbor Light Recovery Center<br>Hope House<br>Eleanora Fagan Center</p>
</div>
</li>
<li class="col d-flex" style="gap: .9rem; min-width: 0;"><span class="fw-bold d-inline-flex align-items-center justify-content-center flex-shrink-0" style="background-color: #002056; border-radius: 50%; color: #fff; font-size: .9rem; height: 36px; width: 36px;">2</span>
<div style="min-width: 0;">
<h3 class="text-uppercase fw-bold" style="color: #002056; font-size: 1rem; letter-spacing: .04em; margin: .4rem 0 .5rem;">Treatment</h3>
<p class="mb-0 text-muted" style="font-size: .9rem; line-height: 1.6;">Harbor Light Residential<br>Pinehearst Women's Recovery</p>
</div>
</li>
<li class="col d-flex" style="gap: .9rem; min-width: 0;"><span class="fw-bold d-inline-flex align-items-center justify-content-center flex-shrink-0" style="background-color: #002056; border-radius: 50%; color: #fff; font-size: .9rem; height: 36px; width: 36px;">3</span>
<div style="min-width: 0;">
<h3 class="text-uppercase fw-bold" style="color: #002056; font-size: 1rem; letter-spacing: .04em; margin: .4rem 0 .5rem;">Housing</h3>
<p class="mb-0 text-muted" style="font-size: .9rem; line-height: 1.6;">Joseph McFee Center<br>Wells Place<br>Railton Place<br>James Baldwin Place</p>
</div>
</li>
<li class="col d-flex" style="gap: .9rem; min-width: 0;"><span class="fw-bold d-inline-flex align-items-center justify-content-center flex-shrink-0" style="background-color: #002056; border-radius: 50%; color: #fff; font-size: .9rem; height: 36px; width: 36px;">4</span>
<div style="min-width: 0;">
<h3 class="text-uppercase fw-bold" style="color: #002056; font-size: 1rem; letter-spacing: .04em; margin: .4rem 0 .5rem;">Independence</h3>
<p class="mb-0 text-muted" style="font-size: .9rem; line-height: 1.6;">Alumni Support Network</p>
</div>
</li>
</ol>
</section>
<!-- CREDIBILITY -->
<section id="why">
<div class="d-flex align-items-center" style="gap: .9rem; margin-bottom: .5rem;"><img style="height: 44px; width: auto;" src="https://8hxvw8tw.media.zestyio.com/shield-1.svg" alt="The Salvation Army shield">
<h2 class="f-ajenson mb-0" style="color: #ef3e42; font-size: 2rem;">Why The Salvation Army</h2>
</div>
<div style="background-color: #ef3e42; height: 3px; margin: 0 0 1.5rem; width: 60px;"></div>
<div class="card" style="border: 1px solid #e2e5ea; border-radius: 14px;">
<div class="card-body row g-4" style="margin: 0; padding: clamp(1.25rem,3vw,2rem);">
<div class="col-lg-6 d-flex flex-column" style="gap: 1rem;">
<div class="text-uppercase fw-bold" style="color: #002056; font-size: .72rem; letter-spacing: .1em; margin-bottom: -.25rem;">Our History</div>
<p class="mb-0">For the past 140 years, The Salvation Army San Francisco has served the city's poor and unhoused. We're one of the city's largest nonprofit landowners.</p>
<p class="mb-0">The Way Out isn't a pilot. It's a scaled system with a track record, a recovery model, and real results donors can measure. It launched California's first Recovery System of Care, offering a proven path from the streets to independence.</p>
</div>
<div class="col-lg-6">
<div class="text-uppercase fw-bold" style="color: #002056; font-size: .72rem; letter-spacing: .1em; margin-bottom: .75rem;">What We Offer</div>
<ul class="mb-0 d-flex flex-column" style="color: #002056; gap: .6rem; padding-left: 1.2rem;">
<li>Treatment on Demand with real-time access to detox, stabilization, and shelter</li>
<li>Two to four years of post-treatment recovery housing paired with life skills and workforce development</li>
<li>Culinary Training Academy with credentials, placement, and a career path</li>
<li>Alumni Support Network because recovery is a journey, not a destination</li>
</ul>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</section>
<!-- DONATION -->
<section id="give" class="text-white text-center" style="background-color: #002056; border-radius: 20px; padding: clamp(1.75rem,5vw,3.25rem) clamp(1.25rem,6vw,5rem);">
<div class="mx-auto" style="max-width: 760px;">
<div style="background-color: #ef3e42; height: 3px; margin: 0 auto 1.5rem; width: 52px;"></div>
<h2 class="f-ajenson" style="color: #fff; font-size: clamp(1.6rem,3.2vw,2.3rem); line-height: 1.2;">Your investment doesn't buy a bed. It buys a life back.</h2>
<p class="mb-4">Every gift, of any size, helps someone take the next step from the streets to a life of their own.</p>
<a class="btn btn-primary btn-lg" href="https://give-gs.salvationarmy.org/give/336361?wayout=true&amp;_ga=2.135698103.729685781.1706639656-212087624.1705156517#!/donation/checkout" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Support The Way Out</a>
<p class="mt-4 mb-0" style="font-size: .9rem;">Or give via stock or DAF: <a style="color: #fff;" href="https://salarmy.us/StockDAF" target="_blank" rel="noopener">salarmy.us/StockDAF</a></p>
</div>
</section>
<!-- STAY INFORMED -->
<section id="stay-informed" style="background-color: #f8f9fa; border-radius: 20px; padding: clamp(1.25rem,3vw,2.5rem);">
<div class="row align-items-start g-4">
<div class="col-lg-5">
<h3 class="f-ajenson" style="color: #002056; margin-bottom: .5rem;">Not ready to give yet? Stay informed.</h3>
<p class="text-muted mb-0">Get monthly updates on The Way Out – real stories, outcomes data, and how your community is responding to the crisis.</p>
</div>
<div class="col-lg-7"><form class="row g-2" action="https://sanfrancisco.salvationarmy.org/san_francisco/the-way-out---get-involved" method="get" target="_blank">
<div class="col-12 col-md-8"><input class="form-control form-control-lg" name="email" required="" type="email" placeholder="Your email address" aria-label="Email address"></div>
<div class="col-12 col-md-4"><button class="btn btn-outline-primary btn-lg w-100" type="submit">Keep Me Updated</button></div>
</form>
<p class="text-muted mb-0 mt-2" style="font-size: .8rem;">No spam. Unsubscribe anytime. Your information stays with The Salvation Army.</p>
</div>
</div>
</section>
